@startuml
!theme plain
hide footbox
title Save a note: UDF and operation outcome
actor User
participant "Page / EditForm" as Page
participant "Create.Container" as C
participant "Relux Dispatcher" as D
participant "Notes Flow" as F
participant "Notes Service / Fetcher" as S
participant "Store / BusinessState" as B
participant "UIState / List.Container" as U
User -> Page : Save local draft
Page -> C : onCreate(note) callback
C -> D : actions { Effect.upsert(note) }
D -> F : apply(effect) via RootSaga
F -> S : upsert(note)
alt accepted by service
 S --> F : success
 F -> D : Action.upsertNoteSuccess(note)
 D -> B : reduce(action)
 B --> D : reduction returns
 par scheduled UI delivery
  B ->> U : Combine projection on main queue
  U -> U : list props refresh
 else operation outcome
  D --> F : action result
  F --> D : success
  D --> C : success
  C -> Page : dismiss
 end
else invalid content or service failure
 S --> F : failure(err)
 F -> D : upsertNoteFail + track(error) concurrently
 D -> B : failure action (keeps existing notes)
 note over D : ErrorHandling saga tracks the error.
 D --> F : dispatch returns
 F --> D : failure(err)
 D --> C : failure
 C -> Page : error message; retain draft
end
note over B,U
Reduction is awaited. Combine delivery and SwiftUI rendering
are asynchronous; flow success is not a screen-render barrier.
end note
@enduml
